{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 <strong>Pogo-Stick: Ultimate Challenge</strong> \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Jump. Fall. Suffer.</strong> \ud83c\udf00</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game will test not only your skills, but your will to persevere. There are no saves or checkpoints \u2014 one wrong move, and you're back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple controls, brutal journey</strong>: Control your hero on a spring-loaded pogo stick using just your mouse. Compress the spring, aim, and jump. Miss by a millimeter \u2014 prepare to fall and rage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>No mercy, no excuses</strong>: There's no room for weakness. Fall hundreds of times, scream in frustration \u2014 but get back up and try again. Those who reach the top become legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Are you ready for the challenge?</strong>\u00a0If you're ready to push your limits and feel the thrill of true victory, welcome to <i>Pogo-Stick: Ultimate Challenge</i>.<br><br>\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>WARNING: This is a rage game.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/fall.gif?t=1747481268\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Accept the challenge:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf32 Jump through forests, cliffs, and rage-inducing obstacles<br>\ud83d\udc80 Expect to fall hundreds of times<br>\ud83d\udd25 Feel the pain of every failed jump<br>\ud83c\udfc6 Earn your victory the hard way \u2014 or not at all</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3663980/e10c0ca0e034a1c0edb39ffb10bcbf85d8501e65.jpg"},{"name":"Path of the Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3663980/7ffbfa7ef4cecff5c09220492885fb30c70143a4.jpg"},{"nam